* slide command tests: cis-routing to voice 2, downward glide, same-pitch no-op.
*   slide 3e,4g,2  -> glide 3e to 4g over a half note on voice 2 (cis 2).
title   SLIDE2
tempo   120,4
measure 1
voice   2
volume  5,5
cis     2
3c 1
measure 2
slide   3e,4g,2
4g 2
4c 2
measure 3
slide   4g,3g,1
3g 1
measure 4
cis     1
slide   4c,4c,2
4c 2
4e 2
cstop*